OL,3,GNEWSALodge used as holiday home for 12
OL,4,Ayears without planning permission
OL,5,
OL,6,FA holiday let in a popular seaside
OL,7,Fvillage has been allowed to keep
OL,8,Foperating despite having had no
OL,9,Fplanning permission for the past 12
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FLuke and Debra Smith applied for
OL,13,Fpermission to keep the converted
OL,14,Foutbuilding, in Saundersfoot,
OL,15,FPembrokeshire, as a short-term holiday
OL,16,Flet.
