OL,3,GNEWSALodge used as holiday home for 12
OL,4,Ayears without planning permission
OL,5,
OL,6,FPembrokeshire Coast National Park
OL,7,Fplanners granted permission after
OL,8,Freviewing evidence that suggested the
OL,9,Fone-bed lodge had been used as a
OL,10,Fcommercial short-term holiday for at
OL,11,Fleast 10 years - long enough to escape
OL,12,Fplanning enforcement action.
OL,14,FCaban bach has an Airbnb rating of 4.88
OL,15,Fout of five, placing it among the
OL,16,Ftop-rated accommodation in the area,
OL,17,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,18,FReporting Service.
